    "Name": "Kharon 1",
    "Details": "Born from the logistical chaos of the Scientist Rebellion, the Kharon is a 70-ton FrankenMech first assembled at the Balk Facility on Glory from an extensive collection of salvaged components. Powered by a 350 XL engine, it combines heavy-cavalry mobility with an iATM-12, ER Large Laser, and Improved Heavy Large Laser, supported by a Targeting Computer and Nova CEWS. The original Kharon proved instrumental in defending the facility and later became a symbol of the Society's evacuation of the Clan Homeworlds.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "Kharon"
  },
